--- a/policy.c
+++ b/policy.c
@@ -187,8 +187,13 @@
 		 * If this is the case, block assoc even when assoc steering is enabled.
 		 *
 		 * Otherwise, the client potentially ends up in a assoc - kick loop.
+		 * Block only if the client has a reachable better candidate: if this
+		 * node is the best it can get, a weak link beats no link.
